WEBVTT

00:26.620 --> 00:29.100
It’s... coming again!

00:31.490 --> 00:32.750
No!

01:01.330 --> 01:02.790
No! Don’t come!

01:05.290 --> 01:08.380
DEMON PRINCE ENMA

01:18.300 --> 01:20.350
PRODUCED BY: KAZUMI KAWASHIRO

01:22.850 --> 01:24.810
