01:55.130 --> 01:56.660
Decide quickly.

01:57.260 --> 01:58.580
Will you come with me...

01:59.100 --> 02:00.960
or be destroyed right here?

02:00.140 --> 02:02.140
MUSIC BY: KAYO KONISHI
